  PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/Mathlib/Analysis/SpecialFunctions/Log/Basic.lean -> Li2Lean/Vendor/PNT/Mathlib/Analysis/SpecialFunctions/Log/Basic.lean
  PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/Rectangle.lean -> Li2Lean/Vendor/PNT/Rectangle.lean
  PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/ResidueCalcOnRectangles.lean -> Li2Lean/Vendor/PNT/ResidueCalcOnRectangles.lean

Modifications (2026-10-13, Li2Lean project), also listed in each file header:

  - module paths and imports renamed from PrimeNumberTheoremAnd.* to
    Li2Lean.Vendor.PNT.*;
  - `import Architect` removed, together with every `@[blueprint ...]`
    attribute and `blueprint_comment` block (documentation metadata only);
  - Consequences.lean truncated after `chebyshev_asymptotic`, and its unused
    `import PrimeNumberTheoremAnd.Defs` removed (Defs.lean is not vendored);
  - Wiener.lean truncated after `WeakPNT`, and `prelim_decay_2`,
    `AbsolutelyContinuous`, `prelim_decay_3`, `decay_alt` removed (the two
    `prelim_decay_*` theorems have no proof upstream; none is used by `WeakPNT`);
  - Rectangle.lean and ResidueCalcOnRectangles.lean retain only the rectangle, Cauchy-Goursat, and simple-pole sections needed by the B4 contour route; the pull-to-neighborhood and global sum-residue sections are omitted.
  - a provenance header added to each file.

Declaration names, statements and proofs of all retained declarations are
otherwise unchanged.
